OL,3,GNEWSANo babies to be born at Daisy Hill
OL,4,AHospital in service suspension plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo babies will be delivered at Daisy
OL,7,FHill Hospital in Newry if plans for a
OL,8,Ftemporary suspension of services go
OL,9,Fahead amid "significant" workforce
OL,10,Fpressures.
OL,12,FThe Southern Health and Social Care
OL,13,FTrust, which oversees the hospital,
OL,14,Fsaid it has not been able to recruit
OL,15,Fconsultant obstetricians to fill
OL,16,Fvacancies and it is preparing to
OL,17,Ftemporarily move inpatient maternity
OL,18,Fservices to Craigavon Area Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
