OL,3,GNEWSANo babies to be born at Daisy Hill
OL,4,AHospital in service suspension plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is thought ante and postnatal
OL,7,Fclinics will continue in Newry but
OL,8,Falternative arrangements will be made
OL,9,Ffor women due to have their babies in
OL,10,FDaisy Hill from November.
OL,12,FHowever, campaigners are concerned that
OL,13,Fit could mean another service moves
OL,14,Faway from the hospital.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
